      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPIRIT OF SAHARA (1) put the writing on the wall when he came from a few spots wider and finished second last time out, beaten 1.7 metres in a far better performance at Pinjarra. The ace draw should give him his chance to go one better. VINITA ROSE NZ (9) has had two runs this prep and while yet to finish in the top three she showed improvement for fifth here last week, beaten 6 metres. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position but she usually races well when third-up so can progress further. STAPLETON (3) draws well again and is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish third at this venue. LORD PUBLISHER NZ (10) draws for a trail and could be dangerous if he gets the gaps.",
